1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:02,405
(Sheldon:)I'm starting my own convention.

2
00:00:04,732 --> 00:00:07,142
(Leonard:)Sheldon, just buy
scalped tickets with us.

3
00:00:07,302 --> 00:00:10,802
(Sheldon:)I told you. Buying scalped
tickets is against the rules.

4
00:00:10,972 --> 00:00:14,282
(Sheldon:)If you get caught, you get
banned from Comic-Con for life.

5
00:00:14,442 --> 00:00:15,822
(Sheldon:)Life, Leonard.

6
00:00:15,977 --> 00:00:18,117
(Sheldon:)You're gonna feel pretty silly
when we're 80 years old,

7
00:00:18,279 --> 00:00:19,549
(Sheldon:)and you have to drive me down there

8
00:00:19,714 --> 00:00:21,454
(Sheldon:)and then wait in the car
for three days.

9
00:00:23,585 --> 00:00:25,425
(Leonard:)Do what you want.
We're getting scalped tickets.

10
00:00:25,587 --> 00:00:27,997
(Howard:)I already found a guy online
who's willing to sell.

11
00:00:28,156 --> 00:00:30,226
(Sheldon:)How do you know
this isn't a sting operation

12
00:00:30,391 --> 00:00:32,391
(Sheldon:)set up by the Comic-Con police?

13
00:00:33,795 --> 00:00:36,905
(Leonard:)The same way I know that the people
in the TV set can't see me.

14
00:00:38,433 --> 00:00:39,503
(Howard:)Sheldon, just come with us.

15
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:41,777
(Howard:)You're not gonna make
your own convention.

16
00:00:41,936 --> 00:00:45,006
(Sheldon:)You know, there was a time
when Comic-Con didn't exist at all

17
00:00:45,173 --> 00:00:48,783
(Sheldon:)until one lone dreamer
with a unique vision made it happen.

18
00:00:48,943 --> 00:00:51,823
(Sheldon:)And you mark my words,
I'm gonna rip that guy off.

19
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,800
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yes, I'm starting
my own comic book convention,

20
